<li>Added usage and reliability statistics through TelemetryDeck to help improve Duoveil.</li>
<li>Reports cover launches, onboarding, effect usage, settings, recommendation clicks and errors, along with app version and basic Mac/system information.</li>
<li>Uses a hashed random installation identifier. Screen content, license keys, file paths and account information are excluded.</li>
